### 逐处错误标注
1. organizing activities at campus → organizing campus activities /organizing activities on campus （固定搭配：on campus）
2. It enrichs → They enrich （指代前面 activities，复数；enrich 拼写：enrich，不是 enrichs）
3. school lifes → school life （life 表 “生活”，不可数）
4. What impress me → What impresses me （主语从句作主语，谓语单数）
5. voluntarily teaching → voluntary teaching （用形容词修饰动名词 teaching）
6. this activity greatly supported → this activity offers great support （全文为评述，一般现在时更合适；原句时态混用）
7. fundamental education facilities → basic learning supplies （搭配不地道，物资用 supplies 更适合四级）
8. assisted them in schoolworks → assisted them with their schoolwork （固定搭配 assist sb. with sth.；schoolwork 不可数，无复数）
9. it not only → It not only （句首首字母大写）
10. elevates our ability → improves our abilities （ability 表多种能力可用复数；elevate 不适合搭配能力）
11. the activity like that → activities like this （泛指这类活动，用复数；this 比 that 自然）
12. help people in need really → truly help people in need （副词 truly 放在实义动词前，语序更规范）


### 修正版
	At present, organizing campus activities has become a common phenomenon. They enrich our school life as well as our life experience. What impresses me most is voluntary 
teaching for kids from remote rural areas.
	For one thing, this activity offers great support to kids and brings them warmth. We took plenty of basic learning supplies and books to them, helping them study in a better
environment. Furthermore, we gave lessons to them and assisted them with their schoolwork patiently. For another, it is very meaningful for us to take part in this event. It not 
only cultivates our sense of responsibility, but also improves our abilities.
	From my perspective, we should actively take part in activities like this. Only in this way can we truly help people in need and make steady progress.


